'''Striding Hero'''<ref>{{Mcnet|community-celebration--simburbia-and-striding-hero|Community Celebration: Simburbia and Striding Hero|December 14, 2020|Sofia Dankis}}</ref> is a collection of [[skin]]s released during the [[Community Celebration]] that matches the [[Striding Hero (world)|map of the same name]]. Primarily released for {{JE}}, the skins may also be imported for use in the mobile and computer ports of {{bE}}.

